  "description": "The UI-free core of ArcticGizmo.Avalonia.Palette: the Rgb colour type, WCAG contrast maths (incl. AdjustToMeet), colour-vision-deficiency simulation, the semantic token contract, the palette model + derivation, the 18 built-in palettes, the registry, and JSON/share-code serialisation. No Avalonia dependency, so it can be consumed by non-UI cores, headless tests and alternate heads.",
